      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "AERATION (1) recorded a Grade 5 win two back then missed the frame last time at Capalaba, but drawn Box 1 this time where he has won before. Meets a moderate line up and rates on top this time. IT'S AN ACE (3) started big odds last time but hit the ground running with a slick early split, giving a sight but fading out of it to finish fifth (19.96) at this track over 352m. The form from his last run stacks up well. One of the better hopes. MAYWYN'S CHIEF (2) turned in a modest effort most recently when fifth at this track over 390m behind Canya Shotfire (22.53) in a Grade 5. Warrants plenty of respect. MISS MULGOWIE (7) cannot be ruled out.",
